    "question": "A uniform ring of radius $R$ and cross-sectional area $A$ made of a material of density $\\rho$ and Young's modulus $Y$ is rotating in its own plane about its central axis with angular velocity $\\omega$. The fractional increase in radius of the ring $\\frac{\\Delta R}{R}$ is:",
